  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb236693f9dbe47498f4dd7ccccbfbf3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q16
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "Unity Event System ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng th\u1EBF n\xE0o? Observer
    pattern implement ra sao?"
  choices:
  - text: "C\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng GetComponent \u0111\u1EC3 g\u1ECDi method tr\u1EF1c
      ti\u1EBFp gi\u1EEFa c\xE1c script."
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "Tight coupling, kh\xF4ng bi\u1EBFt event/observer pattern."
  - text: "Unity EventSystem x\u1EED l\xFD UI input. Cho game logic, Observer pattern
      d\xF9ng C# event/Action ho\u1EB7c UnityEvent. T\u1ED1t h\u01A1n l\xE0 ScriptableObject
      Event (Ryan Hipple pattern): EventSO c\xF3 List<Listener>, raise t\u1EEB b\u1EA5t
      k\u1EF3 \u0111\xE2u m\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n reference tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp -
      decoupled ho\xE0n to\xE0n. Tr\xE1nh Singleton v\xE0 tight coupling."
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "Bi\u1EBFt ScriptableObject Event pattern - advanced knowledge."
  - text: "D\xF9ng UnityEvent trong Inspector \u0111\u1EC3 connect events gi\u1EEFa
      c\xE1c object. Ho\u1EB7c d\xF9ng C# event \u0111\u1EC3 notify subscriber."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "Bi\u1EBFt 2 approach ph\u1ED5 bi\u1EBFn."
  category: Unity
